<html><head><title>"Books #29"</title></head><body><pre><b><!-- 7/16/14 -->

<img src="http://primepuzzle.com/books/books.jpg" border="0">

<a href=http://primepuzzle.com/books/books-29.htm>Books #29</a>

1. East of Eden - John Steinbeck
2. The Runner's Guide to the Meaning of Life - Amby Burfoot
3. Let's Pretend This Never Happened - Jenny Lawson
   (copies given to Peeps, Catherine Lyons, Pri)
4. A Son of the Circus - John Irving
5. The Winter of our Discontent - John Steinbeck
6. The Long Valley - John Steinbeck
7. Running and Being - Sheehan
8. The Count of Monte Cristo - Dumas
9. Rules for Old Men Waiting - Pouncey
10. The Kite Runner - Khaled Hosseini
11. Born on a Blue Day - Daniel Tammet
12. Introduction to Computation and Programming Using Python - John V. Guttag
13. In Cold Blood - Truman Capote
14. To Kill a Mockingbird - Harper Lee
15. Learn Python the Hard Way - Zed A. Shaw
16. Elementary Statistics - Allan G. Bluman
17. A Prayer for Owen Meany - John Irving (not owned)
18. The Pillars of the Earth - Ken Follett
19. The Return of the Native - Thomas Hardy
20. The Cider House Rules - John Irving (not owned)
21. Protocol Zero - James Abel
22. The Drifters - James Michener
23. Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil: A Savannah story - John Berendt (not owned)
24. The House of the Spirits - Isabel Allende (not owned)
    <a href=https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/1745459055>https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/1745459055</a>
25. Our Mathematical Universe - Max Tegmark
26. Gerald's game - Stephen King (1991) (not owned)
27. The Lightkeepers - Abby Geni (2016) (not owned)
    <a href=lightkeepers.txt>My review</a>
28. Chemistry - The Central Science - Brown et al 6th ed. - gift from Mohamed
29. The Days of Abandonment - Elena Ferrante (10/19/16) (not owned)
    <a href=abandonment.txt>My review</a>
30. My Brilliant Friend - Elena Ferrante (11/13/16) <a href=MY_BRILL.TXT>My review</a>
31. The Story of a New Name - Elena Ferrante (12/2/16) (not owned)
32. Those Who Leave and Those Who Stay - Elena Ferrante (1/17)
33. The Story of the Lost Child - Elena Ferrante (1/17)

<img src="Screenshot from 2016-11-15 06-01-19.png">

34. Becoming Wise An Inquiry into the Mystery and Art of Living - Krista Tippett (2016)
35. The Evolution of Calpurnia Tate - Jacqueline Kelly
36. Tuck Everlasting - Natalie Babbitt
37. The Last First Day - Carrie Brown
38. Crashing Through - Robert Kurson (2016 Xmas gift from Sally)
39. These is my Words - Nancy E. Turner (2014? Xmas gift to Linda from Sally) <a href=https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/1898047624>My review</a>
40. QED The Strange Theory of Light and Matter - Richard Feynman
41. CDB  - William Steig
42. Beatrice The Untold Story of a Legendary Woman of Mystery - Sheldon Bart
</pre>

</body></html>

