$Disk write error on NZCOM.CCP - aborting!
$ This program contains a NZCOM operating system.
 The NZCOM system will replace the current system if
 the name of this file is typed with no arguments.

 When running in a ZCPR3 environment, pending commands
 will be appended to the NZCOM multiple command line,
 allowing the NZCOM system to be loaded as part of an
 alias script.

 If a single NZCOM system is always used, the /F option
