                           Menu 1

              Show me a [D]irectory of the files on this drive
 
                      [N]ame file #1 (currently)  $f1 
                      [E]dit file #1
                      [V]iew file #1


                      Run [F]ATCAT cataloguer
                      [H]elp System

                      Think of an [A]nimal
                      Play Quatris (like Tetris)

                      Issue [Z]-System command

#
@ echo p%>ress ^%<c^[) %>to exit %<menu
d !dir
n !silent setfile 1 "file ? "
s !/sa
e !zde $f1
z !"Your command: " 
f a0:;fatcat;$d$u:
h /help
a cls;0:;animals;$d$u:
v !xox $f1
q a0:;quatris;$d$u:
#

                     Menu 2 

             System file 1 : $f1   System file 2 : $f2
             System file 3 : $f3   System file 4 : $f4

                      ~ or ` - Scroll files

                      E. EDIT $f1 with ZDE

                      D. DOS directory 
                      M. MBASIC
                      B. BASCOM =$n1/z/o/e
                      L. L80 z3hdr,cmd,$n1,$n1/n/e
                      S. Establish System file n
                      P. EXPORT $f1

                      Z. Issue Z-System command

#
~ silent /scroll
` silent /scroll
? !echo ^j^i^ip%>ress ^[(%^%<c^[) %>to exit %<menu^j
d !dosdir "filespec "
m mbasic
b !bascom =$n1/z/o/e
l !l80 z3hdr,cmd,$n1,$n1/n/e
e !zde $f1
p !export $f1
s silent setfile "file # ? " "file ? "
z !"Your command: " 
#$

                           System Menu

                      D. Change C.DSK to dbase.dsk
                      W. Change C.DSK to work.dsk

                      Z. Issue Z-System command
                     

