tlz - Tuesday, September 20, 2016 at 13:49:09 (GMT) (subtract 4 for local time)

8 m total - 1 m w/u, 1.5 m c/d, 3 x 10 min @ 8:16, 1 m @ 8:19 w/3 min. rest
in between.  Another wet diaper day. :/

lrb - Tuesday, September 20, 2016 at 17:26:22 (GMT) (subtract 4 for local time)

<a href=https://connect.garmin.com/modern/activity/1370761713>https://connect.garmin.com/modern/activity/1370761713</a>

Slow 5 in the humidity. Took side trip to where my neighbor will move to.
Linda joined me at Highland Rd w/ cold drink and we walked back to her car
and drove home.

MCT - Wednesday, September 21, 2016 at 09:58:51 (GMT) (subtract 4 for local time)

5.5 miles in Seekonk MA. Turned the very same ankle that just healed. Was
crossing a road construction site. Sore but may not be bad enough to skip
Hogsback.

<a href=https://connect.garmin.com/modern/activity/1371675801>https://connect.garmin.com/modern/activity/1371675801</a>

