January 11, 2020

Dear Chas,

The amaryllis is doing great.
Thanks a lot! We'll be using
the potting soil & rocks for
other plants as well.

I recently tweaked my
handwriting program so here's
my thank you note for Xmas
2019 to you :-)

<img src=http://primepuzzle.com/charles/amarylli.jpg>

Much love,

Lee

<a href=http://primepuzzle.com/charles/AMARYLLI.TXT>AMARYLLI.TXT</a>

