      E) Verify default if no query or answer ..................    

      F) Suppress display of SYS files .........................    
      G) Sort files by name (YES) or type (NO) .................    
      H) Filter VIEW and PRINT output ..........................    

      I) Set attributes in copied files ........................    
      J) Use attributes of destination file (if one exists) ....    
      K) Set archive attribute in destination file .............    
␀
                       MACRO RELATED CONFIGURATION

      A) Macro leadin character (HEX) ..........................     
