      C) User Register for tagged # storage ....................    
      D) Erase ZEX file after use ..............................    

      E) Use path to search for CMD file .......................    
      F) Use root if no path search for CMD file ...............    
      G) Fixed user area for CMD file ..........................    
      H) Fixed drive for CMD file (A=0) ........................     

      I) Use root of path for ZEX batch file ...................    
      J) Fixed user area for ZEX file ..........................    
      K) Fixed drive for ZEX file (A=0) ........................     
␀
                       FILE TAGGING CONFIGURATION

