      request scriptfile.
   BA //<cr> 
      show this help display.
   Options -
      F - Console Flow Control, Resume on any character
      Z - Enable program detail messages.
scriptfile = new commands, default type = CMD.
oldaliasfile = old alias, default type = COM.
The new Alias goes to scriptfile.COM.  BA recognizes ambiguous 
scriptfile names, named directory, drive and user areas.
